mapping "W2700.1" source="W2700" target="302981008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2700 SNOMED CT 302981008 = Swedish ICD-10-SE extension subdividing W27 (Contact with
        nonpowered hand tool) by place (home/residential area) and activity (sport/exercise). No WHO
        ICD-10 analogue. Target SNOMED CT 441193 (concept_code 302981008). Parent W27 crosswalks directly
